{"unit_id":"Happy2Git__dsh-compass#card-zh","repo":"Happy2Git/dsh-compass","commit":"2676d15afb2b9d5a4a62715ea4c83fa7619081e0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compass 是面向 DSH Web 的上下文与文件侧栏插件。它把面板挂入 shell.overlay，并在宿主端提供目录与 Git 数据接口。用户可以浏览目录、查看文本和图片、检查工作区状态与提交历史、打开文件差异，并查看当前会话注入的上下文文档及压缩历史；还可通过 /export 请求下载会话日志 ZIP。文件拖入对话可传递路径信息。适合在 DSH Web 中查看项目文件、追踪会话上下文和检查 Git 变更。使用需具备 web 槽位系统的 DSH 源码构建，不需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:49-58","src/client/index.ts:85-107","src/client/PanelRoot.tsx:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"Happy2Git__dsh-compass#card-en","repo":"Happy2Git/dsh-compass","commit":"2676d15afb2b9d5a4a62715ea4c83fa7619081e0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compass adds a DSH Web sidebar for directory browsing, file previews, injected context, Git history and diffs. Its /export command requests a ZIP of the current session log. It requires a DSH source build with the web slot system.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:49-58","src/client/index.ts:85-107","src/client/PanelRoot.tsx:1-8"]}
